{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_03_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6eeeaebee62f8757b3db0812e9f3c6a460de34f377fd47f9f521b3e187c0a4fb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c09b54a6b1f74265c462120674c54e58e028e0b3ad0113a4da95e66b490793d0",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，是不是那栋大楼？\n315 Production的事务所所在的大楼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d987299356b999712bdc0041846503405202660b78d302b3d4f9ce06f7145b4",
      "text": "哈、哈……终于到了吗？……等等，咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc66694f4604f8eb9f9e91e4f2a89d0448e500ad5bbd6ddd4a79a7fc39c9a2fe",
      "text": "（正要走进同一栋大楼……\n这么说来，难、难道说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc1f7403b49e306f9c4d9ba55efa23e42880b6a875bc28bf392a69151eef67d8",
      "text": "那个，不好意思，那边的神仙……\n不对，那边的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f16cebe64a4ce57285ae114709fea368dc6fcb1b7d9188084d711113b78b105e",
      "text": "你是315 Production的，相关人员吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26abc5509d2590998fdababd49ef0142fa870e4b37563b1d7523444434dee2c0",
      "text": "是的。请问有什么……咦？\n您不是前些天在电器街见到的……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffc81b86b141dfa3412e499d9db243b6ad206116084a8460a92c31ef9c7592e7",
      "text": "是的，当时多谢了。\n……原来如此，目的地是一样的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dfbad04fb08ba8079122fc620e7b7af4771ed1ff4359e2497fbad439e965925",
      "text": "啊！这本杂志是偶像情报杂志吧。\n难道说，您对偶像有兴趣……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c57b763e79abfbc67582b286d5ce9308b1be49b48a2e7f49048d2b171277d174",
      "text": "Yes！我们是看了这本magazine找过来的☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a84ff625ff63e4541529e467fab1dc28d2fb641b5d0ba37f668f3c030ac5f06",
      "text": "既然是这样的话，请进里面吧。\n请务必让我和二位详谈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd8a9ee1c7e5875439a2bd2d0f01565d224cb92710a7868268e851632c85aeb",
      "text": "能遇到事务所的人……\n今天真是lucky不断呢，Mr. 山下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2042ec89bfd41d20e015dd594d682403ab9c98d24a6e267f5f8764faaa096be6",
      "text": "是啊……大叔我已经心跳加速喘不过气来了。\n到底能不能……好好听进去呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
